// methodology.nv - the illustration of the agent step that the methodology keeps (state-machine-agent-step.portolan.md, format 2.11), copied as it is into `cases/` with the extension
// `.txt` (its links are the links of the methodology's folder), compiled in for the test that pins what the translator says about it.
module alula.machine_agent

/// The text of the illustration of the methodology.
export fn methodology_text() -> str => embed_str("cases/agent-step-methodology.portolan.txt")

/// The text of the English twin of the illustration (state-machine-agent-step.en.portolan.md, the same machine, row for row), copied as it is.
export fn methodology_en_text() -> str => embed_str("cases/agent-step-methodology.en.portolan.txt")
